sketerm shader presets — per-file licensing
============================================

sketerm itself is MIT-licensed. The shaders in this directory are
DATA files loaded at runtime; they are distributed alongside sketerm
("mere aggregation" in GPL terms) and each carries its OWN license:

  crt.glsl           MIT (sketerm original; effects re-implemented
                     from scratch)
  crt-lottes.glsl    Public domain (Timothy Lottes), sketerm port
  crt-easymode.glsl  GPL (EasyMode), ported from RetroArch's
                     libretro/glsl-shaders
  zfast-crt.glsl     GPL-2.0-or-later (Greg Hogan / SoltanGris42),
                     ported from RetroArch's libretro/glsl-shaders

If you redistribute the GPL shader files (modified or not), the GPL's
terms apply to those files. They do not extend to sketerm's code.
